{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53387","headline":"早春霁後山庄即事 · 朱千乘","name":"早春霁後山庄即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"插槿未成篱，啼莺早已知。\n日长春霁後，风暖柳烟宜。\n席户门斜掩，渔舟钓直垂。\n久将松竹比，宁惧岁寒移。\n上药幽前圃，繁花压小枝。\n素琴延翫月，清渭酌临池。\n守道安贫（疑）老，专经数欲奇。\n若爲裁二鬓，羞向镜中窥。\n（日本藏唐抄本《新撰类林抄》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱千乘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}